<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-09T06:56:58.233Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 06:56:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Haiti's prime minister announced that security forces killed gang chief Mathias Saintil in a police operation, while a separate drone strike eliminated the Nan Boston gang leader. The 400 Mawozo gang has offered to negotiate with authorities, and its leader proposed talks after the killings. Salvadoran President Bukele has taunted Haitian forces as they continue intensified anti-gang operations. The United Nations chief condemned a recent attack that killed 47 people. The conflict has produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOVGk2SEZqOHVLd19JVDM1cDB1a0N1TjRCMXJDeTJkdUxHZzd4dFJHd2syemJ3NEwtUXZBcXNSQ01tdGp0ekxwMTk5WU9Xc0d0R240SFQ4RGJ1eC1pN1dDeWtiZjlwc3V5bnlkS1J0bFpCYUpETUV3RUU0cUIyZDRieDg2TC1pN1p3VVZMTzZTRFhaZTM5NGw3ZWFnUjFrYUx4UmlvZnlMTjRFZ0Izd05YOUN0RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPSG83cVJ2TDltT2JOYkVrMFAtbDFsNjV5bUJBN3YtU0JyWkNQaGNBTVdyU0JxblEzZ1B1TVNqT3V1MmJDeWw2WWxtSGFvSGNCcl9xU01adUdaZzRkeEJjNWhxUHRMeXByMmJhOWNUX25HUGl3ampua2kzSmNXUHh3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPaXlJMTRTeE9vYmg3QTl3ZEpFWnREbkVMaTkya085ZDROY3B2eE1xRHVvUlRST3FmY2dsYUN2RHllZHQ0NTRhdmlGTVpvZGlZdjhyR3JoSE9MeWRid0o4TUs0ZE5XQUFRSnprdFNjbkNURnRqWXROQ2Z3R1ppeWYxNk1sSnJwWXRQX0dBNnVSSWNOMFdwUWhnY0xqbEpvYlIwMkl0a1lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOUkdOZEEtMTQ5NzlLdWRCRUlzdVFsWkFoR0xPOTdIV2szN1hTWmNLQTBHejRjVUI0YTU1bDJpUXdONl9VSlQtZU9iLVRTWFhEbi1RLTZuNEJGQTFxZ1JXWVBBRk43Rjl0VXJrTnF5MXNONkM2TFRYRUM3QXVqTVBOR0R0a1o4NkNsZDhUVVNYTzRkTWNvYm4yRFpEWmVfUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&q